# {{PROJECT_NAME}}: Claude Code Project Context

Seeded from dev-tools @ {{DEV_TOOLS_SHA}} — this file is now the project's own; edit freely. A later port of dev-tools changes updates this line to the commit ported from.

Read this file in full before changing anything. It covers workflow, gates and failure patterns. `PRODUCT_SPEC.md` is the source of truth for current behavior.

