<!-- END:push-safe -->
<!-- BEGIN:supabase -->
- The production database is Supabase project `{{SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF}}`, and there is no other copy of it to experiment on.
<!-- BEGIN:schema-by-hand -->
- Schema changes are applied by hand, by the user, in the dashboard SQL editor; a session never applies one.
<!-- END:schema-by-hand -->
