<!-- END:supabase-cli -->
<!-- END:supabase -->
- Throwaway targets are only the session's scratch directory and whatever the prompt names as throwaway; everything else is real.

**When auto mode blocks an action, stop that line of work and report the block: the action, what it was for, and the reason shown; never route around it with another command, a script or another tool.**
Why: a block means the action needs a human's judgment, and a workaround gets the same effect with no one having judged it.

